# w2_l2b_coop Beginner two-stream route: "Brute's Den" for two (designer DB2; ticks:P1|P2; recorded from closed-loop duo bots, build/db2/bot_w2_l2b_coop.gd).
# Gate 'den': P1 waits by the upper lizard, P2 hops over it and drops down the shaft to the lower one; both strike
# on the same tick (the bond), P2 climbs the vine back up and the bone door is open. The co-op Brute: P1 stands a
# few px nearer (its first target), so P2's charged high strike counts; then the Brute guards against the last
# hitter and the other one strikes.
# wf10 boss balance (bosses; re-recorded with a copy of DB2's bot, build/bosses10/bot_w2_l2b_coop.gd, that waits
# for the uncovered head): every counted hit is one club hit (25), then the Brute covers its head, watches and
# uncovers at its next chest beat, where the other hero strikes - 8 hits, fight 45-90 s.
